cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MMGEN in your research or teaching, please cite it as below."
title: "MMGEN: MultiMerge Genomics"
abstract: >-
  Free, open-source genomics toolkit written in Rust, with optional CUDA
  acceleration, a Python API and a web interface: validation, sorting,
  indexing and region queries of VCF, BED, GFF/GTF, SAM/BAM files of any
  size; interval operations; VCF filtering and normalization; FASTQ quality
  reports and trimming; k-mer counting; human-genetics, RNA-seq, CRISPR,
  metagenomics, antimicrobial-resistance, outbreak, 16S and tumor tools for
  teaching and research.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Couto
    given-names: Fernando
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0003-3832-5564"
repository-code: "https://github.com/fbcouto/multimerge-genomics-research"
url: "https://github.com/fbcouto/multimerge-genomics-research"
license: Apache-2.0
